    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        Accelerating mathematical research with <span class="search-hit mathjax">language</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">models</span>: A case study of an interaction with GPT-5-Pro on a convex analysis problem
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Salim%2C+A">Adil Salim</a>
      
