        Inference-Cost-Aware Dynamic Tree Construction for Efficient Inference in Large <span class="search-hit mathjax">Language</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">Models</span>
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Hong%2C+Y">Yinrong Hong</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Tan%2C+Z">Zhiquan Tan</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Hu%2C+K">Kai Hu</a>
      
