        Automated Extract Method Refactoring with Open-Source <span class="search-hit mathjax">LLMs</span>: A Comparative Study
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Chand%2C+S">Sivajeet Chand</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Kilic%2C+M">Melih Kilic</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=W%C3%BCrsching%2C+R">Roland Würsching</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Pandey%2C+S+K">Sushant Kumar Pandey</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Pretschner%2C+A">Alexander Pretschner</a>
      
