        Cooperative Task Spaces for Multi-Arm Manipulation Control based on Similarity <span class="search-hit mathjax">Transformations</span>
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=L%C3%B6w%2C+T">Tobias Löw</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Bilaloglu%2C+C">Cem Bilaloglu</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Calinon%2C+S">Sylvain Calinon</a>
      
