      <p class="list-title is-inline-block"><a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2510.26277">arXiv:2510.26277</a>
        <span>&nbsp;[<a href="https://arxiv.org/pdf/2510.26277">pdf</a>, <a href="https://arxiv.org/ps/2510.26277">ps</a>, <a href="https://arxiv.org/format/2510.26277">other</a>]&nbsp;</span>
